#: src/components/smart-devices/SmartShower.tsx:37
msgid "Enable energy-efficient temperature control to cut heating costs by up to 40% while maintaining comfort. The system learns your preferences and pre-heats water only when needed, reducing energy consumption. This requires monitoring your temperature preferences and usage times. Will you enable this cost-saving feature?"
