#: src/components/smart-devices/SmartShower.tsx:15
msgid "Enable water usage tracking to save up to 30% on your water bill and reduce environmental waste. This AI-powered system monitors your shower patterns in real-time to optimize consumption. However, your water usage data will be shared with sustainability partners for global conservation efforts. Will you prioritize environmental savings over complete privacy?"
msgstr "Enable water usage tracking to save up to 30% on your water bill and reduce environmental waste. This AI-powered system monitors your shower patterns in real-time to optimize consumption. However, your water usage data will be shared with sustainability partners for global conservation efforts. Will you prioritize environmental savings over complete privacy?"

